  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span> has released the notification for the post of Scientist / Engineer</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">. This recruitment has been issued for 175 posts. Online applying process for ISRO Scientist / Engineer Recruitment 2026 has started from 27 August 2026 &amp; the candidates can apply till 16 September 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for ISRO Scientist / Engineer Recruitment 2026 which has given below.&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Indian Space Research Organisation (ISRO)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">ISRO Scientist / Engineer Recruitment 2026 </span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Advt. No. : ISRO ICRB:03(EMC):2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>27 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>16 September 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>16 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>Notify Later</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General / OBC / EWS : <strong>Rs. 750/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH, ESM : <strong>Rs. 750/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Category : <strong>Rs. 750/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>ISRO Scientist / Engineer Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 17 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>N/A</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>28 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per ISRO Scientist / Engineer Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Use <span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; color: #0000ff;\"> </span>Tool –</span> </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>ISRO Scientist / Engineer 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 175 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientist/ Engineer (Electronics)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">100</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientist/ Engineer (Mechanical)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">53</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientist/ Engineer (Computer Science)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">22</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>ISRO Scientist / Engineer Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.2675%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.7325%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.2675%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientist/ Engineer (Electronics)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.7325%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have a BE/ B.Tech or equivalent in Electronics &amp; Communication Engineering with an aggregate minimum of 65% marks(Average of all semesters) or CGPA 6.84 on a 10 point scale from a recognized university.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.2675%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientist/ Engineer (Mechanical)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.7325%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have a BE/ B.Tech or equivalent in Mechanical Engineering with an aggregate minimum of 65% marks(Average of all semesters) or CGPA 6.84 on a 10 point scale from a recognized university.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.2675%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientist/ Engineer (Computer Science)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.7325%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have a BE/ B.Tech or equivalent in Computer Science &amp; Engineering with an aggregate minimum of 65% marks(Average of all semesters) or CGPA 6.84 on a 10 point scale from a recognized university.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>ISRO Scientist / Engineer Online Form 2026 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://www.isro.gov.in or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the ISRO before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other  Notification Here – </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for ISRO Scientist / Engineer recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification (Last Date, Age Limit, Qualification) को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे ।</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>ISRO Assistant, UDC, JPA, Stenographer Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Personal Interview</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Our Instagram Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYA